sequenceDiagram
    participant PY as Payment Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant US as User Service
    participant DB as notification_db
    PY->>MQ: PaymentSucceeded
    MQ-->>NS: PaymentSucceeded
    NS->>DB: eventId déjà traité ?
    DB-->>NS: Non
    NS->>US: GET /api/users/7
    US-->>NS: Coordonnées du client
    NS->>DB: Enregistrer Notification (PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED)
    NS->>NS: Envoyer (IN_APP / EMAIL)
    NS->>DB: Statut = SENT
